# Mechanic: artifacts alone do not grant affinity to Juggernaut.
# Forcing: the same two-artifact count, but two mana cannot pay the four-generic spell.
# AI behavior: no hand or battlefield, so no opposing choices affect the offer.
# Failure modes: an offered Juggernaut would admit an unaffordable cast; a hang fails continuation.
# Card roles: two Ornithopters hold artifact count constant, Juggernaut checks affordability.
# Protocol path: absent active Cast, preserved hand, then continued land play.
# Paired with: affinity-granted.pzl and affinity-without-golem-payable.pzl.
